<tt xmlns="http://www.w3.org/ns/ttml" xmlns:ttm="http://www.w3.org/ns/ttml#metadata" xmlns:itunes="http://music.apple.com/lyric-ttml-internal" xmlns:amll="http://www.example.com/ns/amll" itunes:timing="Line" xml:lang="en"><head><metadata><amll:meta key="ncmMusicId" value="27867906"/><amll:meta key="appleMusicId" value="784399900"/><amll:meta key="musicName" value="Boys be Smile"/><amll:meta key="artists" value="鈴湯 / VISUAL ARTS"/><amll:meta key="album" value="Boys be Smile / 目覚めた朝にはきみが隣に"/><amll:meta key="ttmlAuthorGithub" value="149807805"/><amll:meta key="ttmlAuthorGithubLogin" value="Ma-hiru"/></metadata></head><body dur="04:25.180"><div begin="00:11.020" end="04:25.180"><p begin="00:11.020" end="00:17.320" itunes:key="L1">ひとりじゃ寂しい<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">独自一人孤独难耐</span></p><p begin="00:17.320" end="00:23.250" itunes:key="L2">だから手を繋いだんだっけ<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">于是抓住了来自你们的手掌</span></p><p begin="00:23.250" end="00:29.540" itunes:key="L3">それじゃいつまでも<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">这样以来无论何时</span></p><p begin="00:29.540" end="00:33.180" itunes:key="L4">子供のままだ<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">都如幼年时光</span></p><p begin="00:33.180" end="00:41.350" itunes:key="L5">どうしても伝えたかったんだ<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">无论如何都想要把它告诉你</span></p><p begin="00:41.350" end="00:47.590" itunes:key="L6">繋いだ手はもう<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">曾经牵起来的手</span></p><p begin="00:47.590" end="00:53.820" itunes:key="L7">ばらばらになる<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">已变得七零八落</span></p><p begin="00:53.820" end="00:57.380" itunes:key="L8">ひとつずつ消えてゆく<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">一个接一个逐渐消逝</span></p><p begin="00:57.380" end="01:06.530" itunes:key="L9">目覚める日へ<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">向着觉醒之日</span></p><p begin="01:06.530" end="01:16.080" itunes:key="L10">とっとと走っていけ<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">〖毅然决然迈出脚步〗</span></p><p begin="01:16.080" end="01:22.350" itunes:key="L11">誰もが幸せに<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">谁都能得到幸福</span></p><p begin="01:22.350" end="01:28.030" itunes:key="L12">なれることなんかなくて<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">这种事情是不可能实现的</span></p><p begin="01:28.030" end="01:34.370" itunes:key="L13">神はサイコロを<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">神将手中骰子</span></p><p begin="01:34.370" end="01:38.770" itunes:key="L14">振るって笑うだけだ<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">挥手甩下淡然笑曰</span></p><p begin="01:38.770" end="01:46.250" itunes:key="L15">そしてまた朝が来る<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">但是我仍坚信着清晨仍会</span></p><p begin="01:46.250" end="01:52.060" itunes:key="L16">繋げ未来へと<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">向着紧系的未来</span></p><p begin="01:52.060" end="01:58.660" itunes:key="L17">闇から信じる<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">从黑暗之中来临</span></p><p begin="01:58.660" end="02:02.150" itunes:key="L18">それだけは忘れない<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">唯有这点我不会忘记</span></p><p begin="02:02.150" end="02:11.470" itunes:key="L19">どんな微かでも<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">无论多么的微笑</span></p><p begin="02:11.470" end="02:18.620" itunes:key="L20">みんなを愛してた<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">对大家的爱都永存</span></p><p begin="02:18.620" end="02:24.890" itunes:key="L21">そばに居たい<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">比起谁都想要</span></p><p begin="02:24.890" end="03:03.130" itunes:key="L22">誰よりもずっと<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">永远呆在你的身旁</span></p><p begin="03:03.130" end="03:09.450" itunes:key="L23">もう輪はなくなった<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">齿轮已经停止了转动</span></p><p begin="03:09.450" end="03:15.540" itunes:key="L24">やり終えたってこと<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">终于迎来了终结之时</span></p><p begin="03:15.540" end="03:21.680" itunes:key="L25">ふたりきりでも<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">即使你我二人</span></p><p begin="03:21.680" end="03:25.430" itunes:key="L26">もう強さを得たはず<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">也会得到应有的坚强</span></p><p begin="03:25.430" end="03:34.320" itunes:key="L27">だからもう行く<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">所以说快动起来</span></p><p begin="03:34.320" end="03:59.140" itunes:key="L28">きっと大丈夫さ<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">一定没有问题的</span></p><p begin="03:59.140" end="04:06.100" itunes:key="L29">どんな楽しいことも<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">无论怎样愉悦的事</span></p><p begin="04:06.100" end="04:12.980" itunes:key="L30">いつかは終わるもの<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">最终也将会迎来终结</span></p><p begin="04:12.980" end="04:19.770" itunes:key="L31">お祭りのようなもので<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">哪怕如同祭典一般的快乐</span></p><p begin="04:19.770" end="04:19.920" itunes:key="L32">寂しいだけ<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">也唯剩寂寞</span></p><p begin="04:19.920" end="04:20.130" itunes:key="L33">hitori ja samishii</p><p begin="04:20.130" end="04:20.320" itunes:key="L34">dakara te wo tsunaidandakke</p><p begin="04:20.320" end="04:20.410" itunes:key="L35">sore ja itsumademo</p><p begin="04:20.410" end="04:20.690" itunes:key="L36">kodomo no mama da</p><p begin="04:20.690" end="04:20.710" itunes:key="L37">doushitemo tsutaetakattanda (isshun no yume no naka)<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">〖也唯剩寂寞〗</span></p><p begin="04:20.710" end="04:20.830" itunes:key="L38">tsunaida te wa mou (kiseki wo okoshi futari wo mimamottekita basho)</p><p begin="04:20.830" end="04:21.080" itunes:key="L39">barabara ni naru</p><p begin="04:21.080" end="04:21.150" itunes:key="L40">hitotsuzutsu kiete yuku</p><p begin="04:21.150" end="04:21.420" itunes:key="L41">mezameru hi e</p><p begin="04:21.420" end="04:21.520" itunes:key="L42">tottoto hashitte yuke</p><p begin="04:21.520" end="04:21.780" itunes:key="L43">dare mo ga shiawase ni</p><p begin="04:21.780" end="04:21.890" itunes:key="L44">nareru koto nanka nakute</p><p begin="04:21.890" end="04:22.000" itunes:key="L45">kami wa saikoro wo</p><p begin="04:22.000" end="04:22.130" itunes:key="L46">furutte warau dake da</p><p begin="04:22.130" end="04:22.360" itunes:key="L47">soshite mata asa ga kuru (eien no taiyou ga)</p><p begin="04:22.360" end="04:22.370" itunes:key="L48">tsunage mirai e to (ironna mono ya keshiki wo mitekita futari ni)</p><p begin="04:22.370" end="04:22.690" itunes:key="L49">yami kara shinjiru</p><p begin="04:22.690" end="04:22.820" itunes:key="L50">sore dake wa wasurenai</p><p begin="04:22.820" end="04:23.080" itunes:key="L51">donna kasuka de mo</p><p begin="04:23.080" end="04:23.180" itunes:key="L52">minna wo aishiteta</p><p begin="04:23.180" end="04:23.360" itunes:key="L53">soba ni itai</p><p begin="04:23.360" end="04:23.530" itunes:key="L54">dare yori mo zutto</p><p begin="04:23.530" end="04:23.630" itunes:key="L55">mou wa wa nakunatta (hitotsu no wakka sae)</p><p begin="04:23.630" end="04:23.840" itunes:key="L56">yari oetatte koto (kiseki wa sameta ato ni wa nanimo nokoranai)</p><p begin="04:23.840" end="04:24.070" itunes:key="L57">futari kiri demo</p><p begin="04:24.070" end="04:24.250" itunes:key="L58">mou tsuyosa wo eta hazu</p><p begin="04:24.250" end="04:24.390" itunes:key="L59">dakara mou iku</p><p begin="04:24.390" end="04:24.580" itunes:key="L60">kitto daijoubu sa</p><p begin="04:24.580" end="04:24.740" itunes:key="L61">donna tanoshii koto mo</p><p begin="04:24.740" end="04:24.860" itunes:key="L62">itsuka wa owaru mono</p><p begin="04:24.860" end="04:24.910" itunes:key="L63">matsuri no you na mono de</p><p begin="04:24.910" end="04:25.180" itunes:key="L64">samishii dake</p></div></body></tt>